OL,3,GNEWSARare banknotes donated to charity
OL,4,Ashop sell for more than #85,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA collection of rare banknotes donated
OL,7,Fto a charity shop in Edinburgh has sold
OL,8,Ffor more than #85,000 at auction.
OL,10,FAlmost 160 notes from around the world
OL,11,Fwere donated in albums to the British
OL,12,FHeart Foundation (BHF) shop at Straiton
OL,13,FRetail Park.
OL,15,FShop volunteers noticed the potential
OL,16,Fsignificance of the collection and it
OL,17,Fwas passed on to specialist auction
OL,18,Fhouse Noonans.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
